OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells 
OL,6,Fat first leading to another frost in   
OL,7,FLanarkshire. Rain reaching the Isles   
OL,8,Fand west coast later this evening      
OL,9,Fedging into the mainland overnight.    
OL,10,FStrengthening southeasterly winds.     
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of      
OL,13,Frain, preceded by some wet snow on the 
OL,14,Fhighest ground though remaining as     
OL,15,Fsnow on Argyll Hills. Rain turning     
OL,16,Fheavier later. Fresh to strong         
OL,17,Fsoutheasterly winds.                   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
