OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain  
OL,6,Fdying out on Wednesday then mainly dry 
OL,7,Fon Thursday. More cloud and rain       
OL,8,Fspreading from west on Friday.         
